# Rig 2 orchestrator environment — deploy to /etc/ocs-orchestrator/orchestrator.env (mode 0600)
# One worker (ocs-llama, all GPUs). GROUP_B_MODEL_ALIAS is empty on purpose: no Worker B on Rig 2.
GROUP_A_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8081
GROUP_A_MODEL_ALIAS=qwen3.6:35b-a3b
GROUP_B_MODEL_ALIAS=
# Same value as WORKER_API_KEY in /etc/ocs-intelligence/worker.env. Never hand this to students.
WORKER_API_KEY=CHANGE_ME_COPY_FROM_WORKER_ENV
# Keys accepted from callers (Open WebUI, operators). Never leave empty: empty accepts any token.
PUBLIC_API_KEYS=CHANGE_ME_GENERATE_A_STUDENT_KEY
QUEUE_CAPACITY_PER_WORKER=16
CONNECT_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=5
RESPONSE_HEADER_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=600
STREAM_IDLE_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=300
HEALTH_INTERVAL_SECONDS=5
